=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11ae441f721da51cf93ad22008f3fc28 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there,  I love the way you draw so much. I'd love it If you can draw my Vtuber character. She's a cute, shy and happy marshmallow bunny girl. Here is what she looks like https://imgur.com/fP4qDzK https://imgur.com/WwBw2JY. I will leave the pose to you, but I'd like the expression to be shy and cute please. I would like a separate layers for the character, backgrounds, and signatures. I would like to use this on my Twitch, twitter and YouTube and will leave full credit to you. Thank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hinoe_mon/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2aa4ea1f/uploads/origins/696114a9-c278-4016-ba02-abee1db5a3b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4e3867f7cd00af156013afa7e184d1f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2aa4ea1f/uploads/origins/696114a9-c278-4016-ba02-abee1db5a3b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4e3867f7cd00af156013afa7e184d1f, https://si.imgix.net/2aa4ea1f/uploads/origins/696114a9-c278-4016-ba02-abee1db5a3b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdad4e989032884d3fef785bb8c0a42f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2aa4ea1f/uploads/origins/696114a9-c278-4016-ba02-abee1db5a3b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18ebe5f0b1eba77b85039022f807e5e3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。ファンアートを贈りたい方がいるので依頼させていただきます。\n\nして相手はVtuberの千堂じゅんさんです。\n衣装は赤い上着(上着の肩辺りにある模様は海苔付きのおせんべいです)を羽織っているもので。\n\nポーズは右手、または左手どちらかを胸に当てて。笑顔(又は微笑み)を浮かべているというものでお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/sendo_jun/status/1440307464289669132/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hinoe_mon/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/25ed687d/uploads/origins/a1c14650-43d2-4804-9d8a-c6ada931b57